{"name":"Lust","hex":"#e62020","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"lust","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A feeling of strong desire, especially such a feeling driven by sexual arousal.","A general want or longing, not necessarily sexual."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To look at or watch with a strong desire, especially of a sexual nature.","To desire."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/lust"}],"entries":[{"title":"Lust","blocks":[{"text":"Lust is an intense desire for something. Lust can take any form such as the lust for sexual activity, money, or power; but it can also take such mundane forms as the lust for food or the lust for redolence. Lust is similar to, but distinguished from, passion, in that properly ordered passion propels individuals to achieve benevolent goals whilst lust does not."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6f/Jheronimus_Bosch_Table_of_the_Mortal_Sins_%28Luxuria%29.jpg/330px-Jheronimus_Bosch_Table_of_the_Mortal_Sins_%28Luxuria%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lust","wikidata":"Q6498477"},{"title":"Shades of red","blocks":[{"text":"Varieties of the color red may differ in hue, chroma, lightness, or in two or three of these qualities. Variations in value are also called tints and shades, a tint being a red or other hue mixed with white, a shade being mixed with black. A large selection of these various colors is shown below."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/Shades_of_Red.svg/330px-Shades_of_Red.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shades_of_red","wikidata":"Q7460345"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cb/Daemon.jpg/500px-Daemon.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimed